{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:15 2026-08-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:15 2026-08-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:15 2026-08-25 HKT</p><p>今(25日)中午1時51分，姓郭(76歲)男子乘船到喜靈洲碼頭登岸，其後他返回船上期間，意外跣腳跌落海。猶幸他懂水性，自行游返船上，船隻駛到油麻地避風塘，警員接報到場，尋獲郭男，他左臉受傷，救護員為他貼上紗布敷治，其後送往廣華醫院治理。警方將案件列作有人意外受傷。</p><img alt=\"墮海男子送院檢驗。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9c74759d3b09740df1c80f06ab50ecd2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_14_55_27_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/05a4c3e2a5f978c7d2846aa506c180a1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_14_55_27.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"水警到場。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/03e8ae66d481b7b977539eaa62f5baf6/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_14_55_28_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/496b82e3199f49d033c89a0c090cfa22/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_14_55_28_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/34e3e00198b7dded671063d6ee211e18/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_14_55_28.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T07:40:01.628649+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}